Support for Engicam MicroGEA-STM32MP257-RMM board with:

 - 8 GB eMMC Flash
 - 2 GB LPDDR4 DRAM
 - CAN
 - LEDs
 - LCD panel with touchscreen
 - Micro SD card connector
 - Audio codec
 - Buzzer

